= Peer review protocol =
A BITwiki peer review evaluates a contribution for source fidelity, logical coherence, semantic fit, uncertainty, reproducibility where applicable, and whether the page distinguishes fact, interpretation, hypothesis, and project proposal.

== Minimum review ==
# Check sources and quotations.
# Check that metadata matches page content.
# Check internal links and semantic relationships.
# Identify unsupported certainty or missing uncertainty.
# Preserve useful disagreement rather than flattening it.
# Record substantial corrections in revision history.

